## Overview

This document defines the API contracts for the Admin Script Editor and User Execution features (EPIC-04).

Related documents:

- Design spec: REF-dynamic-tool-scripts
- ADRs: ADR-0012, ADR-0013, ADR-0014
- Epic: EPIC-04

